{"articleNo":"2137","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2137&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012 브루나이 정부초청 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.11.22","hit":"7987","attachments":[{"name":"붙임3-지원서B PGApplication Form.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2137&attachNo=69228"},{"name":"붙임2-지원서A (소정양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2137&attachNo=69625"},{"name":"붙임5-브루나이 모집요강(영어).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2137&attachNo=69626"},{"name":"붙임1-2012-2013 브루나이 선발요강(국문).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2137&attachNo=69627"},{"name":"붙임4-2011 브루나이 DB양식.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2137&attachNo=70252"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t브루나이 정부에서는 아래와 같이 브루나이 정부 초청 장학생을 선발하고자 하오니, 우리 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.&nbsp;<br><br><!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2012 브루나이 정부초청 장학생 선발요강</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1. 선발 과정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 학사, 석사/박사과정<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. 선발 인원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> : 2명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. 지원 자격</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 대한민국 국민</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 연령: 학사 만 25세, 석박사 만 35세 이하 (2012. 7. 1 기준)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 브루나이 영주권자는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">지원할 수 없음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 브루나이 정부초청 장학생 입학자격에 충족하는 자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. 장학생 수용 대학</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 브루나이국립대학(Universiti Brunei Darussalam, UBD) 등 (UNISSA, ITB)<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">5. 장학금 수혜기간 및 시작 시기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 장학금 수혜 기간: 학업 소요 기간 (원본 2 참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">나. 시작 시기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 9.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2012년 7, 8월&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">6. 장학금 수혜내역</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수업료 전액</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 왕복 항공권 (이코노미 클래스)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 의료비 : 브루나이 보건부가 지정한 의료기관(치과병원 포함) 무상 치료</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 월 생활비 : 브루나이화 500불(B$500) 등 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">7. 장학생 수용대학별 선발요건</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 웹 사이트 방문하여 브루나이 정부 선발요강 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">8. 기타 장학생 수혜조건 및 유의사항: 본원 웹 사이트 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">9. 지원 절차: 본원 웹 사이트 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 7.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 본원 주소 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국립국제교육원 홈 페이지 -&gt;외국정부초청장학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 전화 02-3668-1389</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 파일 제출처: oijung@mest.go.kr</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 주소: 110-810 서울특별시 종로구 이화장길 81 국립국제교육원 (208호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(국제교류부-외국정부초청장학생 담당)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">붙임 1. 2012-2013 브루나이선발요강(국문)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 지원서A (소정양식)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 지원서B PGApplicationForm</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 2011 브루나이 DB양식</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 브루나이 모집요강(영어)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
